+    "what_IS_established_here": "Independently of the degenerate delta: (a) the 0.04 baseline was itself an LLM-OFF measurement (_NoOpProposer in both exp4605 arms), so the fault cannot have depressed it -- there was no generator contribution to lose; (b) the fault genuinely fired in the 16k arms and is absent from the fixed arms for mode A (n_context_exceeded 36 -> 0). Those two do not depend on the delta."
   },
